## BÖLÜM 3: Veritabanı Migration

### Schema Eşleştirme

| Schema | Modül | İçerik |
|--------|-------|--------|
| `catalog` | Catalog | Hotel, Room, Tour, TourDate, Activity, Route |
| `booking` | Booking | Reservation, Cart, CartItem, GuestInfo |
| `payment` | Payment | Transaction, Invoice, Refund |
| `identity` | Identity | User, Partner, SubUser, Role, Session |
| `review` | Review | Review, PartnerReview |
| `notification` | Notification | Notification, NotificationPreference |

### Yeni Model Template

```prisma
model NewResource {
  id          String    @id @default(cuid())
  title       String    @db.VarChar(200)
  slug        String    @unique
  description String?   @db.Text
  price       Decimal?  @db.Decimal(10, 2)
  status      ResourceStatus @default(DRAFT)

  operatorId  String
  operator    TourOperator @relation(fields: [operatorId], references: [id])

  createdAt   DateTime  @default(now())
  updatedAt   DateTime  @updatedAt
  deletedAt   DateTime?

  @@index([operatorId])
  @@index([status])
  @@schema("catalog")
}
```

### Zorunlu Kurallar
- Her model: `id`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `deletedAt` alanları ŞART
- Her model: `@@schema("{module}")` ŞART
- Her foreign key: `@@index([fkColumn])` ŞART
- Enum'lar da `@@schema()` almalı
- Yeni NOT NULL alan eklerken `@default()` zorunlu
- Migration adı: İngilizce `snake_case` (ör: `create_campaign_table`)

### Migration Komutu
```bash
cd apps/api
pnpm prisma migrate dev --name {descriptive_name}
pnpm prisma generate
```

### Seed Template

```typescript
// apps/api/prisma/seed/{module}.seed.ts
import { PrismaClient } from '@prisma/client';

export async function seedCampaigns(prisma: PrismaClient) {
  const items = [
    { id: 'seed-campaign-1', title: 'Erken Rezervasyon', discountPercent: 20, status: 'ACTIVE' },
  ];
  for (const item of items) {
    await prisma.campaign.upsert({ where: { id: item.id }, update: item, create: item });
  }
  console.log(`✓ Campaign seed (${items.length} kayıt)`);
}
```

